Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800] | Elapsed:   9.02s | Words: 8  | Text: 师父 最近我总觉得有点
Segment #2   [00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,340] | Elapsed:   9.02s | Words: 9  | Text: 哎 流年起伏不用担心了
Segment #3   [00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:08,200] | Elapsed:   9.02s | Words: 11 | Text: 我帮你向过你有二十年大日
Segment #4   [00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,820] | Elapsed:   9.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 二十年之内没问题
Segment #5   [00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:12,040] | Elapsed:   9.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 那二十年以后呢
Segment #6   [00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:14,500] | Elapsed:   9.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 所谓知足者长乐
Segment #7   [00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:17,760] | Elapsed:   9.02s | Words: 12 | Text: 说真的二十年后该退休想伏了
Segment #8   [00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,560] | Elapsed:   9.02s | Words: 3  | Text: 说的也是
